## Develop

```bash
tools/dev-pytest.sh apps/{{ app_name }}/tests          # fast loop
pants lint check test apps/{{ app_name }}::            # source of truth
tools/deploy.py --stage dev-$USER --apps {{ app_name }} --with-deps
```

